\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces Interval coverage against the nominal 0.95 (dashed) by history-length band, frozen regime. The plain Gaussian-process interval under-covers badly; the split-conformal correction restores near-nominal coverage.}}{40}{figure.caption.36}%
